{%- comment -%}
  Universal Atelier Live Customizer Dock (Shopify Theme Snippet)
  Can be included in theme.liquid or any template to allow live on-screen customization of:
  - Name / Titles
  - Font / Typography
  - Background (Color / Gradient / Image)
  - Colors & Accents
  - Spacing & Sizing
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  .universal-customizer-launcher {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    z-index: 99999;
    background: rgba(20, 18, 22, 0.94);
    color: #f7f6f2;
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.5);
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }
  .universal-customizer-launcher:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    background: #0d0c0e;
    border-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.8);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }
  .universal-customizer-launcher .sparkle {
    color: #d4af37;
    animation: ucdSparkle 2s infinite ease-in-out;
  }
  @keyframes ucdSparkle {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.8; }
    50% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 1; }
  }
</style>

<button type="button" class="universal-customizer-launcher" id="UniversalCustomizerLauncher" aria-label="Open Atelier Live Customizer">
  <span class="sparkle">✦</span>
  <span>CUSTOMIZE ATELIER</span>
  <span style="background: rgba(212,175,55,0.2); color: #d4af37; font-size: 9px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 999px; text-transform: uppercase;">Live</span>
</button>
